---
description: Mandatory human-led development flow for this repo.
alwaysApply: true
---

For any development, fix, refactor, or config change, first read and follow
`.claude/skills/human-led-development/SKILL.md` (single source of truth; do not copy its text).

No coding without explicit plan-and-scope approval from a human. Out-of-scope, expired,
or version-mismatched authorization → stop and re-confirm. Same file across tasks →
serial, order decided by the human. Commit, push, MR, merge, release → separately
authorized. Discussion and read-only explanation create no coding permission.

Cursor has no equivalent of Claude Code's PreToolUse deny hook: in this client the rules
are context, not enforcement. The Claude Code gate remains the authority; treat writing
files here as requiring the same approval you would need under the gate.
